          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "“Hi, I'm calling about your courses. — Of course. Which one? — The pottery course for beginners. — Lovely. That's on Mondays… sorry, it's moved to Thursdays this term. It starts at half past six and finishes at eight fifteen. — How much is it? — It's ninety-five pounds for the eight weeks, which includes all the clay. You just need to bring an apron — it gets messy!”"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
