      {
        "type": "blockquote",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "“Welcome to the Central Library. Many of you have asked if we'll extend our opening hours — I'm afraid that's not possible yet. However, I'm happy to say that the new children's area on the ground floor opened in March. We were also planning a café, but that's been postponed until next year. If you want to use one of our computers, you don't need to book online any more — just ask at reception and they'll give you a code.”"
              }
            ]
